:name: R4 / Experiment 5 rung A - the REAL Sesame S2 ELF on the stock platform
:description: AUTHORITATIVE run. firmware/artifacts/s2mini/sesame-firmware-main.ino.elf
:description: (F3, ELF sha256 5436d303...9eedfd) loaded onto the checked-in
:description: esp32s2-sesame platform exactly as R2/R3 use it. No boot ROM, no
:description: synthesised processor state, no MMIO shims.
:description:
:description:   node emulator/renode/tests/r4-run.mjs emulator/renode/scripts/r4-exp5-sesame-stock.resc r4-exp5-sesame-stock 120

using sysbus

mach create "r4-sesame-a"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @emulator/renode/platforms/esp32s2-sesame.repl

logLevel 1
sysbus LoadELF @firmware/artifacts/s2mini/sesame-firmware-main.ino.elf

echo ""
echo "### entry PC"
cpu PC

emulation RunFor "0.05"

echo ""
echo "### final PC"
cpu PC
echo "### executed instructions"
cpu ExecutedInstructions

quit
